{
  "$schema": "https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry-item.json",
  "name": "theme",
  "title": "Webcraft 토큰",
  "description": "면 네 단계(sidebar < background < card < popover) · 글자색 강조 · 업무 표식 · 일정 분류 색, Pretendard · JetBrains Mono, 64rem 분기점과 휴대폰 글자 크기, bg-dots · squircle 유틸리티, 조작 면 토큰(control · control-hover · control-on · control-border), 화면 전환(콘텐츠 영역 .route-content · 휴대폰 유리 막대 · 대화상자 바꿔 끼우기 · 페이지로 열기). 다크 모드는 html(:root)의 data-theme=dark(dark: 변형도 같다). 다른 키트 항목이 모두 이것에 기댄다. 받는 프로젝트는 Webcraft FSD 별칭(components.json의 ui → @/shared/ui/kit, components → @/shared/ui, lib · hooks → @/shared/lib, utils → cn(패키지))을 쓴다.",
  "dependencies": [
    "pretendard",
    "@fontsource-variable/jetbrains-mono",
    "tw-animate-css"
  ],
  "cssVars": {
    "theme": {
      "font-sans": "'Pretendard Variable', Pretendard, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, system-ui, 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Malgun Gothic', sans-serif",
      "font-mono": "'JetBrains Mono Variable', 'SF Mono', Consolas, monospace",
      "breakpoint-md": "64rem",
      "color-row-hover": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 4%, var(--background))",
      "color-band": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--muted) 55%, var(--background))",
      "color-unread": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 9%, var(--background))",
      "color-unread-strong": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 14%, var(--background))",
      "color-state-description": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--icon-muted) 75%, var(--background))",
      "radius-surface": "1rem",
      "shadow-surface": "0 1px 2px var(--shadow-color), 0 0 0 1px var(--border)",
      "color-card": "var(--card)",
      "color-card-foreground": "var(--card-foreground)",
      "color-popover": "var(--popover)",
      "color-popover-foreground": "var(--popover-foreground)",
      "color-primary": "var(--primary)",
      "color-secondary": "var(--secondary)",
      "color-secondary-foreground": "var(--secondary-foreground)",
      "color-accent": "var(--accent)",
      "color-accent-foreground": "var(--accent-foreground)",
      "color-border": "var(--border)",
      "color-input": "var(--input)",
      "color-ring": "var(--ring)",
      "color-pressed": "var(--pressed)",
      "color-sidebar-foreground": "var(--sidebar-foreground)",
      "color-sidebar-primary": "var(--sidebar-primary)",
      "color-sidebar-accent": "var(--sidebar-accent)",
      "color-sidebar-accent-foreground": "var(--sidebar-accent-foreground)",
      "color-sidebar-border": "var(--sidebar-border)",
      "color-sidebar-ring": "var(--sidebar-ring)",
      "color-control": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 5%, var(--background))",
      "color-control-hover": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 9%, var(--background))",
      "color-control-on": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 14%, var(--background))",
      "color-control-border": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 11%, var(--background))"
    },
    "light": {
      "background": "#f9f9fa",
      "foreground": "#1b1b1b",
      "sidebar": "#efeff0",
      "primary-foreground": "#ffffff",
      "muted": "#ececed",
      "muted-foreground": "#5c5c5e",
      "destructive": "oklch(0.577 0.245 27.325)",
      "icon-muted": "#6b6b6f",
      "shadow-color": "rgb(0 0 0 / 0.04)",
      "chart-1": "oklch(0.87 0 0)",
      "chart-2": "oklch(0.556 0 0)",
      "chart-3": "oklch(0.439 0 0)",
      "chart-4": "oklch(0.371 0 0)",
      "chart-5": "oklch(0.269 0 0)",
      "radius": "0.5rem",
      "sidebar-primary-foreground": "#ffffff",
      "mark-backlog": "#d7d7da",
      "mark-progress": "#524622",
      "mark-done": "#374c36",
      "mark-urgent": "#c62f39",
      "mark-high": "#b8550b",
      "mark-medium": "#8b6900",
      "mark-low": "#2865c3",
      "illustration-accent": "#4a7fd4",
      "event-blue": "#d7e4f5",
      "event-blue-foreground": "#3c4856",
      "event-green": "#d0e9ce",
      "event-green-foreground": "#374c36",
      "event-orange": "#ffdcbb",
      "event-orange-foreground": "#5b4227",
      "event-purple": "#e8dff3",
      "event-purple-foreground": "#4b4454",
      "event-red": "#f9dcd7",
      "event-red-foreground": "#58413e",
      "event-teal": "#d4e7dc",
      "event-teal-foreground": "#3b4a41",
      "event-pink": "#f0dde8",
      "event-pink-foreground": "#52424c",
      "event-yellow": "#f4e1b7",
      "event-yellow-foreground": "#524622",
      "event-gray": "#e3e3e4",
      "event-gray-foreground": "#46464b",
      "day-off": "#d1242f",
      "saturday": "#0969da"
    }
  },
  "css": {
    "@import \"pretendard/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.css\"": {},
    "@import \"@fontsource-variable/jetbrains-mono\"": {},
    "@custom-variant dark (&:where(:root[data-theme=dark], :root[data-theme=dark] *))": {},
    "@custom-variant compact (&:where([data-density=compact] *))": {},
    ":root": {
      "--text-sm": "0.8125rem",
      "--text-sm--line-height": "1.5",
      "--text-base": "0.9375rem",
      "--text-base--line-height": "1.6",
      "--card": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--background) 25%, #ffffff)",
      "--card-foreground": "var(--foreground)",
      "--popover": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--background) 15%, #ffffff)",
      "--popover-foreground": "var(--foreground)",
      "--primary": "var(--foreground)",
      "--secondary": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 10%, var(--background))",
      "--secondary-foreground": "var(--foreground)",
      "--accent": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 4%, transparent)",
      "--accent-foreground": "var(--foreground)",
      "--border": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 9%, var(--background))",
      "--input": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 18%, var(--background))",
      "--ring": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 72%, var(--background))",
      "--pressed": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 7%, transparent)",
      "--sidebar-foreground": "var(--foreground)",
      "--sidebar-primary": "var(--foreground)",
      "--sidebar-accent": "var(--pressed)",
      "--sidebar-accent-foreground": "var(--foreground)",
      "--sidebar-border": "var(--border)",
      "--sidebar-ring": "var(--ring)"
    },
    ":root[data-theme=dark]": {
      "--background": "#121213",
      "--foreground": "#f7f8f8",
      "--sidebar": "#09090a",
      "--card": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 3%, var(--background))",
      "--popover": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 6%, var(--background))",
      "--primary-foreground": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--background) 85%, #000000)",
      "--secondary": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 13%, var(--background))",
      "--muted": "#232326",
      "--muted-foreground": "#8a8f98",
      "--accent": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 5%, transparent)",
      "--destructive": "oklch(0.704 0.191 22.216)",
      "--border": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 8%, var(--background))",
      "--input": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 16%, var(--background))",
      "--icon-muted": "#8a8f98",
      "--pressed": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 8%, transparent)",
      "--shadow-color": "rgb(0 0 0 / 0.3)",
      "--sidebar-primary-foreground": "var(--primary-foreground)",
      "--mark-backlog": "#5e5e61",
      "--mark-progress": "#d7c59c",
      "--mark-done": "#b4cdb2",
      "--mark-urgent": "#f17880",
      "--mark-high": "#efa15f",
      "--mark-medium": "#e6c45b",
      "--mark-low": "#79a7ee",
      "--illustration-accent": "#6ea2ef",
      "--event-blue": "#485362",
      "--event-blue-foreground": "#d7e4f5",
      "--event-green": "#425841",
      "--event-green-foreground": "#d0e9ce",
      "--event-orange": "#684d32",
      "--event-orange-foreground": "#ffdcbb",
      "--event-purple": "#564f60",
      "--event-purple-foreground": "#e8dff3",
      "--event-red": "#644d49",
      "--event-red-foreground": "#f9dcd7",
      "--event-teal": "#46564d",
      "--event-teal-foreground": "#d4e7dc",
      "--event-pink": "#5e4e57",
      "--event-pink-foreground": "#f0dde8",
      "--event-yellow": "#5e512d",
      "--event-yellow-foreground": "#f4e1b7",
      "--event-gray": "#303032",
      "--event-gray-foreground": "#e2e2e8",
      "--day-off": "#ff7b72",
      "--saturday": "#6cb6ff"
    },
    "@media not all and (min-width: 64rem)": {
      ":root": {
        "--text-xs": "0.8125rem",
        "--text-sm": "0.9375rem",
        "--text-base": "1.0625rem"
      }
    },
    "@utility bg-dots": {
      "background-image": "radial-gradient(color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px)",
      "background-size": "1rem 1rem"
    },
    "@utility squircle": {
      "corner-shape": "squircle"
    },
    ".route-content": {
      "view-transition-name": "app-content"
    },
    "::view-transition": {
      "pointer-events": "none"
    },
    "::view-transition-group(app-content)": {
      "animation-duration": "200ms",
      "animation-timing-function": "ease-in-out"
    },
    "::view-transition-image-pair(app-content)": {
      "isolation": "isolate"
    },
    "::view-transition-old(app-content)": {
      "animation": "app-content-out 200ms ease-in-out both",
      "mix-blend-mode": "plus-lighter"
    },
    "::view-transition-new(app-content)": {
      "animation": "app-content-in 200ms ease-in-out both",
      "mix-blend-mode": "plus-lighter"
    },
    ".phone-bar": {
      "view-transition-name": "app-phone-bar"
    },
    ".phone-bar-search": {
      "view-transition-name": "app-phone-search"
    },
    "::view-transition-group(app-phone-bar), ::view-transition-new(app-phone-bar), ::view-transition-group(app-phone-search), ::view-transition-new(app-phone-search)": {
      "animation": "none"
    },
    "::view-transition-old(app-phone-bar), ::view-transition-old(app-phone-search)": {
      "display": "none"
    },
    "::view-transition-image-pair(app-phone-bar), ::view-transition-image-pair(app-phone-search)": {
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "border-radius": "9999px"
    },
    "@media (min-width: 48rem)": {
      "::view-transition-image-pair(app-content)": {
        "overflow": "hidden",
        "border-radius": "calc(var(--radius-surface) * 1.5)",
        "corner-shape": "squircle"
      }
    },
    "@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)": {
      "::view-transition-group(app-content), ::view-transition-old(app-content), ::view-transition-new(app-content)": {
        "animation": "none"
      }
    },
    ":root[data-vt=\"dialog\"] .route-content": {
      "view-transition-name": "none"
    },
    ":root[data-vt=\"dialog\"] [data-slot=\"dialog-content\"][data-panel]": {
      "view-transition-name": "panel-dialog"
    },
    "::view-transition-group(panel-dialog)": {
      "animation-duration": "200ms",
      "animation-timing-function": "cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1)"
    },
    "::view-transition-image-pair(panel-dialog)": {
      "isolation": "isolate",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "border-radius": "1rem"
    },
    "::view-transition-old(panel-dialog)": {
      "animation": "app-content-out 200ms ease-in-out both",
      "mix-blend-mode": "plus-lighter"
    },
    "::view-transition-new(panel-dialog)": {
      "animation": "app-content-in 200ms ease-in-out both",
      "mix-blend-mode": "plus-lighter"
    },
    ":active-view-transition-type(panel-expand) .route-content": {
      "view-transition-name": "panel-expand"
    },
    ":active-view-transition-type(panel-expand):has([data-slot=\"dialog-content\"][data-panel]) .route-content": {
      "view-transition-name": "none"
    },
    ":active-view-transition-type(panel-expand) [data-slot=\"dialog-content\"][data-panel]": {
      "view-transition-name": "panel-expand"
    },
    ":active-view-transition-type(panel-expand) [data-slot=\"dialog-overlay\"]": {
      "view-transition-name": "panel-expand-backdrop"
    },
    "::view-transition-group(panel-expand)": {
      "animation-duration": "250ms",
      "animation-timing-function": "cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1)"
    },
    "::view-transition-image-pair(panel-expand)": {
      "isolation": "isolate",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "border-radius": "1rem"
    },
    "::view-transition-old(panel-expand)": {
      "animation": "app-content-out 120ms ease-out both"
    },
    "::view-transition-new(panel-expand)": {
      "animation": "app-content-in 250ms ease-out both"
    },
    "::view-transition-old(panel-expand-backdrop)": {
      "animation": "app-content-out 250ms ease-out both"
    },
    ".fade-strip": {
      "--fade-l": "0px",
      "--fade-r": "0px",
      "mask-image": "linear-gradient(to right, transparent, currentColor var(--fade-l), currentColor calc(100% - var(--fade-r)), transparent)"
    },
    ".fade-strip:not([data-start])": {
      "--fade-l": "1.5rem"
    },
    ".fade-strip:not([data-end])": {
      "--fade-r": "1.5rem"
    },
    "@layer base": {
      "@keyframes app-content-out": {
        "from": {
          "opacity": "1"
        },
        "to": {
          "opacity": "0"
        }
      },
      "@keyframes app-content-in": {
        "from": {
          "opacity": "0"
        },
        "to": {
          "opacity": "1"
        }
      },
      "@keyframes toast-countdown": {
        "from": {
          "transform": "scaleX(1)"
        },
        "to": {
          "transform": "scaleX(0)"
        }
      },
      "button:not(:disabled):not([aria-disabled=\"true\"]), [role=\"button\"]:not([aria-disabled=\"true\"]), [role=\"menuitem\"]:not([aria-disabled=\"true\"]):not([data-disabled]), [role=\"option\"]:not([aria-disabled=\"true\"]):not([data-disabled]), [role=\"tab\"]:not([aria-disabled=\"true\"]), [role=\"checkbox\"]:not([aria-disabled=\"true\"]), [role=\"switch\"]:not([aria-disabled=\"true\"]), [role=\"radio\"]:not([aria-disabled=\"true\"]), [cmdk-item]:not([data-disabled=\"true\"]), summary, label:has(input:not(:disabled)), select:not(:disabled)": {
        "cursor": "pointer"
      },
      "@keyframes page-state-enter": {
        "from": {
          "opacity": "0",
          "transform": "translateY(0.375rem)"
        },
        "to": {
          "opacity": "1",
          "transform": "none"
        }
      },
      "body": {
        "font-weight": "450"
      },
      "html": {
        "@apply font-sans": {}
      },
      "@media (min-width: 1920px)": {
        "html": {
          "font-size": "max(100%, min(118.75%, 19px, calc(100% + 0.46875vw - 9px)))"
        }
      },
      "*": {
        "scrollbar-width": "thin",
        "scrollbar-color": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 16%, transparent) transparent"
      },
      "*:hover": {
        "scrollbar-color": "color-mix(in srgb, var(--foreground) 28%, transparent) transparent"
      }
    }
  },
  "docs": "다크 모드는 html(:root)의 data-theme=dark입니다. 라우터가 그리는 자리(Outlet을 감싼 요소)에 route-content 클래스를 달면 화면 전환이 그 영역만 잡습니다. shadcn init이 남긴 .dark { … } 블록과 @custom-variant dark (&:is(.dark *)) 줄은 지웁니다(뒤에 더한 data-theme 변형과 겹칩니다). 모드는 @webcraft/appearance가 data-theme에 반영합니다.",
  "type": "registry:theme"
}